<h2 id='reference-configurationpageblock'><code>ConfigurationPageBlock</code></h2>
<p>One of Banner, Form, Guide, or Iframe block.</p>

<p>One of the following:</p>

<ul>
<li><a href="#reference-bannerblock"><code>BannerBlock</code></a></li>
